# Ad teasers cut from the finished video by 05-cut-teasers.sh.
# One teaser per line: name  segID[:maxdur]  [segID:maxdur]
# A teaser is one segment opening, or two glued together (hook + demo).
# maxdur limits how many seconds are taken from the segment start.
#
# A teaser must make sense on its own: never start it mid-list ("Third, ...")
# and never cut it right before the payoff the hook promises.
v1 01:13 03:15
v2 05:25
